{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01HziiyB2tkvp7PNmEqtUGLH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Only one place sets the global subscriber, which is the `setup_tracing_with_log_level` function. So the `TimingMetricsLayer` should be active.\n\nBut `on_new_span` is never called. This means the layer is not receiving events. But the `ForestLayer` IS receiving events (we see the tree output). So the layer chain is working... unless... the `TimingMetricsLayer` is somehow not being included.\n\nWait, let me re-read the setup:\n\n```rust\nlet subscriber = Registry::default()\n    .with(env_filter)\n    .with(ForestLayer::default())\n    .with(MetricsLayer::new());\n#[cfg(feature = \"metrics\")]\nlet subscriber = subscriber.with(TimingMetricsLayer::new());\ntracing::subscriber::set_global_default(subscriber).unwrap();\n```\n\nAh, there's a `#[cfg(feature = \"metrics\")]` guard! If the `metrics` feature isn't enabled for `cli-openvm-riscv`, the `TimingMetricsLayer` never gets added to the subscriber chain. And `cli-openvm-riscv` has `default = [\"metrics\"]` in its Cargo.toml, so it should be enabled by default.\n\nWhen building with `cargo build --bin powdr_openvm_riscv -r --features \"metrics,cuda\"`, the `--features` flag applies to workspace members, and since `cli-openvm-riscv` is the binary being built, `--features metrics` should enable it. But `metrics` is already a default feature anyway, so it should be active regardless.\n\nUnless... `cli-openvm-riscv` is being compiled with `default-features = false` somewhere? But it's a binary crate, not a library, so nothing depends on it and default features should always be enabled. I need to understand how the `--features` flag actually behaves with workspace builds and whether it's somehow overriding the defaults.\n\nLet me try a different approach and just add a simple check to verify whether the `metrics` feature is actually enabled at compile time.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":340,"cache_read_input_tokens":97652,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":340},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c42ae86-251a-4856-8c5c-64695b43253b","uuid":"8f606101-6cbb-4dff-b028-0109876a8ebc"}
